"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.5.dev.custom_build [be3ecaeb3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (be3ecaeb3) - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed, 30 Apr 2025 19:24:32 +0000 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XT (RADV NAVI31) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen executing a shell script with `OS.execute_with_pipe`, and then checking the exit code with `OS.get_process_exit_code`, I get a `0` code, even though the script explicitly fails with `exit 1` (see MRP).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nvar dict := OS.execute_with_pipe(\"/bin/bash\", [\"-c\", \"./script.sh\"], false)\nvar pid := dict.pid as int\nwhile OS.is_process_running(pid):\n\tcontinue\nprint(\"Exit code: %d\" % OS.get_process_exit_code(pid))\n```\nwith `script.sh` containing the following:\n```bash\nexit 1\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[process-exit-code.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20353278/process-exit-code.zip)\n\nThe MRP contains a very simple bash script (`echo \"Printing from bash script\"` and `exit 1`), which is executed by both `OS.execute` and `OS.execute_with_pipe`. `OS.execute` returns `1` as expected, but `OS.get_process_exit_code` returns `0` after `OS.execute_with_pipe`. Following is the MRP's output:\n\n```\nOS.execute\nExecute exit code: 1\n[\"Printing from bash script\\n\"]\n\nOS.execute_with_pipe\nPipe exit code: 0\nPrinting from bash script\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106644/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}